msgctxt "80"
msgid "Yeah, a boy named Akihiko bought a bottle from us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"He spends a lot of time at Ryukyu Shogi, the shogi hall on Kubochi Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Excuse me, I've got a question for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Yes, how can I help you?"
msgstr "Sì, posso aiutarla?"

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I found this bottle. Is this something you sell here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh, yes! We do have that one in stock here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Know anyone who might've bought one recently?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Hmm, let's see... You know, there's a boy who comes here every year around "
"this time to buy just one bottle. Wonder what it's for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "A boy? Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm sure. Even know his name: Akihiko. He lives pretty close to here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"He spends a lot of time at Ryukyu Shogi, the shogi hall on Kubochi Road."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"He's probably the only kid there. Those shogi halls are filled with old "
"retirees. He should stick out like a sore thumb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "A boy named Akihiko, at the Ryukyu Shogi hall. Thanks for the tip."
msgstr ""

